id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0065","name":"潘濬","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0056","name":"士仁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0057","name":"麋芳","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-8d07e968b82a6eee26dc","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-3bc18ddf9d07d9917101","layer":"original","quote":"权闻之，即引兵西袭公安、江陵。羽遂见擒","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":369,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":164,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-b192fa995ef8ee2a38da","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-ffe3df8382e2c02cd193","layer":"original","quote":"权军至，得其二城，羽乃破败","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":272,"end":285,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-70854b5f7653ecd1186b","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-51d41a232534f63df917","layer":"original","quote":"孙权袭羽，遂入吴","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":362,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-16dc4b02f597093385c1","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o008","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-b96955cde6bd0ef2541b","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖1〗，先主为汉中王；拜羽为前将军，假节、钺。是岁，羽率众攻曹仁于樊。曹公遣于禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水泛溢，禁所督七军皆没；禁降羽，羽又斩将军庞德〖2〗；梁、郏、陆浑群盗或遥受羽印号〖3〗，为之支党。羽威震华夏〖4〗，曹公议徙许都，以避其锐。司马宣王、蒋济以为：“关羽得志，孙权必不愿也。可遣人劝权蹑其后〖5〗，许割江南以封权，则樊围自解。”曹公从之。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o035a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-83834db77f87d5f2c6c1","layer":"original","quote":"闰月〖12〗，权征羽。先遣吕蒙袭公安，获将军士仁〖13〗；蒙到南郡，南郡太守麋芳以城降〖14〗。蒙据江陵，抚其老弱，释于禁之囚。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-39b849dfb87fdd3c9c49","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖8〗，关羽围曹仁于襄阳；曹公遣左将军于禁救之〖9〗。会汉水暴起，羽以舟兵尽虏禁等步骑三万，送江陵，惟城未拔。权内惮羽，外欲以为己功；笺与曹公〖10〗，乞以讨羽自效〖11〗。曹公且欲使羽与权相持以斗之，驿传权书；使曹仁以弩射示羽，羽犹豫不能去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-202570869e3cbb43dc7f","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-27e79ab5543b5b176ad3","layer":"original","quote":"南郡太守麋芳开城出降","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-43c3850a9ef831e590b9","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-36fc85af01c76df52293","layer":"original","quote":"权至，释之，请与相见","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
